The .nbt structure templates in this folder are unmodified copies from the mod.
BigCasares reads them at datapack build time, replaces their placeholder blocks,
rewrites their jigsaw connectors and re-themes their blocks for each culture;
the modified templates exist only inside the generated datapack.
